{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10132350","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10132350","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1013235001:0":{"text":"一回しか会えないのが残念！とても面白そうなセレスチアル様だったのになぁ。","source_cn":"可惜只见了一面，好遗憾！看起来是位很有趣的半神大人呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB306C01497E6E03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1013235002:0":{"text":"セレスチアルであるサジタリス様のお力は、「面白い」だけでは片付けられないぞ……","source_cn":"半神萨基塔里斯的实力，可绝不仅是“有趣”而已……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74B55D975ADA5ECE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013235003:0":{"text":"かつての神魔大戦で、デューラ様に選ばれたサジタリス様はセレスチアルに昇格し、カタストロフとの抗争に尽力された……","source_cn":"在神魔大战中，萨基塔里斯被艾雅选中，升格为半神，致力于...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C784EBA0E82B7E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013235004:0":{"text":"サジタリス様は計り知れないほど強いってことですよ！","source_cn":"所以说，萨基塔里斯大人是深不可测的强者！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FBC43152B8B62B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1013235005:0":{"text":"神魔大戦？あたし歴史は得意じゃないんだけど……それってかなり昔のことだよね？","source_cn":"神魔大战？我历史可能不太好……那不是很久之前的事情吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DF0DEA7B8FA343C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1013235006:0":{"text":"ああ、遠い昔のことだ……","source_cn":"没错。很久之前了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0787480AF511EFEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:菲":{"text":"フィー","source":"菲","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:特弥希娅":{"text":"テミシア","source":"特弥希娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢修斯":{"text":"ルシウス","source":"卢修斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":3}}